+2) Cluster & Core Services
+ - Namespace aegis created, PVCs bound, RBAC & NetworkPolicies applied
+ - Milvus installed and healthy, MLflow reachable, Redis replication ok
+ - Prometheus & Grafana installed and dashboards provisioned
+ - Backups scheduled and restoration tested in staging
+
+3) Moderation & Safety
+ - Moderation provider configured (AWS / Google / vendor)
+ - Moderation verdicts are signed & recorded to evidence bucket
+ - Watermarking & provenance enabled for generated assets
+
+4) Factuality & Calibration
+ - Labeled dataset collected; calibrator trained and stored thresholds in Vault
+ - Calibrator performance meets required precision/recall
+
+5) Policy & Audit
+ - Delegation matrix populated and policy CI passing
+ - Insurance binder recorded in Vault and insurer signoff tracked
+ - Audit package generated and submitted to auditor
